body('A:')
bullet('[K] A person specification is a document that describes the ideal candidate for a job role, listing the qualifications, skills, experience, and personal attributes required.')
bullet('[An] Purpose: It provides objective criteria for shortlisting and selecting candidates, ensuring the recruitment process is fair, consistent, and focused on finding the best match for the role. It helps avoid discrimination by focusing on job-relevant criteria.')
