h2('Dismissal (Short Answers)')
body('Q: Define dismissal and distinguish between fair and unfair dismissal. [3]')
sp()
body('A:')
bullet('[K] Dismissal is when an employer terminates an employee contract of employment, ending their job.')
bullet('[K] Fair dismissal is for legitimate reasons (misconduct, poor performance despite support, redundancy, legal restrictions). Proper procedures must be followed.')
bullet('[K] Unfair dismissal is when an employee is dismissed without valid reason or without following proper procedures. It may be due to discrimination, pregnancy, trade union membership, or whistleblowing. The employee can take legal action for compensation.')
