body('A:')
bullet('[K] Labour turnover is the percentage of employees leaving a business over a given period. Formula: (Number leaving / Average number employed) x 100.')
bullet('[An] High labour turnover is costly because it requires constant recruitment, selection, and training of replacements. It can also indicate low morale, poor working conditions, or weak management, and disrupts team cohesion and productivity.')
