bullet('[App/An] However, if an existing employee shows design talent, internal recruitment saves cost and time, and the person already understands the brand, culture, and production processes. [An] This reduces the risk of a poor cultural fit.')
bullet('[Ev] Recommendation: External recruitment through specialist creative platforms is most appropriate because costume design requires specific artistic skills that are unlikely to be developed through internal training alone. CC should look for candidates with relevant design qualifications and portfolio evidence. However, using a recruitment agency specialising in creative roles, while more expensive, would handle shortlisting and save management time.')
