body('Q: Define above the line promotion. [2]')
sp()
body('A:')
bullet('[K] Above the line promotion is advertising through mass media channels (TV, radio, newspapers, magazines, billboards, cinema) that reaches a large, broad audience. It is paid-for advertising through media independent of the business.')
